@startuml storefront-order
title Storefront order with card payment (kommunikacio.md 8.1 and 8.3)
actor Shopper
participant "Storefront\n/" as SF
participant "Commerce API\n/api/v1" as API
participant "Demo payment\n/demo-fizetes/" as PAY

Shopper -> SF : browse the catalogue
SF -> API : GET /products?…
API --> SF : 200 ProductPage
SF -> API : GET /products/{slug}
API --> SF : 200 Product
Shopper -> SF : add to cart
SF -> API : POST /cart/items (If-Match)
API --> SF : 200 Cart + ETag
SF -> API : GET /checkout/options
API --> SF : 200 CheckoutOptions
Shopper -> SF : contact, billing, delivery, payment
SF -> API : PATCH /checkout (If-Match)
API --> SF : 200 CheckoutSession + ETag
SF -> API : POST /payment-intents (If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
API --> SF : 201 PaymentIntent (redirectUrl, returnUrl)
SF -> PAY : full page load of redirectUrl
note right of PAY : demo-payment-redirect.puml
PAY -> SF : full page load of returnUrl
SF -> API : GET /payment-intents/{paymentIntentId}
API --> SF : 200 PaymentIntent (succeeded)
SF -> API : POST /orders (If-Match, Idempotency-Key, paymentIntentId)
API --> SF : 201 OrderReceipt
SF --> Shopper : order confirmation
@enduml
